('demi_god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','[TOOL] --wordlist=rockyou.txt hashes.txt','bash','["John the Ripper","curl","HTTPie","OWASP ZAP"]'::jsonb,'["John the Ripper","curl","HTTPie","OWASP ZAP"]'::jsonb,0,'John the Ripper (Password Cracker): Memecahkan hash password lewat serangan kamus atau brute-force offline.','John the Ripper (Password Cracker): Cracks password hashes via dictionary or offline brute-force attacks.','Tools ini bernama John the Ripper, fungsinya: Memecahkan hash password lewat serangan kamus atau brute-force offline.','This tool is called John the Ripper, and it: Cracks password hashes via dictionary or offline brute-force attacks.','Beri file berisi hash; tool mencoba kata-kata umum lalu kombinasi karakter sampai cocok.','Give it a file of hashes; it tries common words then character combinations until one matches.','Hash lambat seperti Argon2id/bcrypt membuat serangan ini jauh lebih mahal dibanding MD5/SHA1 biasa.','Slow hashes like Argon2id/bcrypt make this attack far more expensive than plain MD5/SHA1.'),
