('demi_god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','[TOOL] -X POST -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d ''{"q":1}'' https://target.id/api','bash','["Postman","curl","Chrome DevTools","Wireshark"]'::jsonb,'["Postman","curl","Chrome DevTools","Wireshark"]'::jsonb,1,'curl (HTTP Client (CLI)): Mengirim request HTTP langsung dari terminal untuk menguji API atau endpoint secara manual.','curl (HTTP Client (CLI)): Sends HTTP requests directly from the terminal to manually test an API or endpoint.','Tools ini bernama curl, fungsinya: Mengirim request HTTP langsung dari terminal untuk menguji API atau endpoint secara manual.','This tool is called curl, and it: Sends HTTP requests directly from the terminal to manually test an API or endpoint.','Tambahkan header, method, dan body sesuai kebutuhan pengujian endpoint target.','Add headers, method, and body as needed to test the target endpoint.','Endpoint API yang tidak membatasi method (GET/POST/PUT/DELETE) bisa disalahgunakan — validasi method di server.','An API endpoint that doesn''t restrict methods (GET/POST/PUT/DELETE) can be abused — validate the method server-side.'),
